OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts on schemes backed by
OL,4,Asecond home tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction has begun on two
OL,7,Faffordable housing developments in
OL,8,FNorth Yorkshire partly funded by a
OL,9,Fcouncil tax premium on second homes.
OL,11,FSince April 2025, council tax bills in
OL,12,Fthe county have been effectively
OL,13,Fdoubled for owners of second homes,
OL,14,Fgenerating a projected #10m per year to
OL,15,Fbe spent on creating affordable homes
OL,16,Fand "other projects", according to
OL,17,FNorth Yorkshire Council.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
