OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts on schemes backed by
OL,4,Asecond home tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on two multimillion-pound
OL,7,Fdevelopments is under way in Hunmanby
OL,8,Fand Shipton by Beningbrough, which the
OL,9,Fcouncil said had been "unlocked" by
OL,10,Falmost #900,000 from the second home
OL,11,Fpremium.
OL,13,FHowever, campaigners against the policy
OL,14,Fhave said the impact of the tax on
OL,15,Fcoastal communities and businesses had
OL,16,Fbeen overlooked.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
